    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "One-Bedroom Apartment with Private Patio & Parking – Parklands, Santry\n\nBeautifully presented one-bedroom apartment available to rent in the popular Parklands development in Santry.\n\nThe apartment offers bright, comfortable living accommodation with a good-sized private patio, providing a lovely outdoor space to relax or entertain. The property also benefits from an allocated car parking space, making it particularly convenient for those commuting by car. The car park space is conveniently located right next to the patio seen in the images.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a well-proportioned double bedroom, spacious living area, modern kitchen and bathroom.\n\nLocated in Parklands, Santry, the apartment is ideally positioned for easy access to Dublin City Centre, Dublin Airport, the M1 and M50, with a wide range of shops, restaurants and amenities nearby.\n\nKey features:\n\nOne double bedroom\nSpacious living area\nModern kitchen\nGood-sized private patio\nAllocated car parking space included\nWell-maintained development\nExcellent transport links\nConvenient location for Dublin Airport and Dublin City Centre\nA fantastic opportunity to rent a well-presented one-bedroom apartment with private outdoor space and parking in a highly convenient North Dublin location."
      }
